  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: avro-android 1.11.0.rhlw-00002",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.avro:avro-android 1.11.0.rhlw-00002 with backported fixes for CVE-2023-39410 and CVE-2024-47561.\n\nCVE-2023-39410: Apache Avro Java SDK: Memory when deserializing untrusted data in Avro Java SDK\n\nCVE-2024-47561: Apache Avro Java SDK: Arbitrary Code Execution when reading Avro schema (Java SDK)\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.avro:avro-android 1.11.0 from Maven Central.",
